@startuml
title Cancel an Appointment

start

:Client: Enter portal and choose cancel an appointment option;
:System: Show form asking for info for appointment;
:Client: Enter full name, phone number and zip code; or confirmation number in confirmation email;

if (Appointment found in database) then (yes)
  :System: Ask client to confirm that they would like to cancel this appointment;
  if (Client confirms) then (no)
    :System: Return to landing page;
  else (yes)
    :System: Mark reservation status in database as 'canceled';
  endif
else (no)
  :System: Message that appointment could not be found;
endif

stop
@enduml